.md
We would like to include translations in the same calculation. A translation is affine rather than linear in three coordinates, so we introduce **homogeneous coordinates**: a point becomes `{x, y, z, 1}`. The extra coordinate lets a 4×4 matrix add a translation. It is a *bookkeeping device*, not a rotation into a fourth spatial dimension:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
We would like to include translations in the same calculation. A translation is affine rather than linear in three coordinates, so we introduce **homogeneous coordinates**: a point becomes `{x, y, z, 1}`. The extra coordinate lets a 4×4 matrix add a translation. It is a *bookkeeping device*, not a rotation into a fourth spatial dimension:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
(*GB[*){{1(*|*),(*|*)0(*|*),(*|*)0(*|*),(*|*)tx}(*||*),(*||*){0(*|*),(*|*)1(*|*),(*|*)0(*|*),(*|*)ty}(*||*),(*||*){0(*|*),(*|*)0(*|*),(*|*)1(*|*),(*|*)tz}(*||*),(*||*){0(*|*),(*|*)0(*|*),(*|*)0(*|*),(*|*)1}}(*||*)(*1:eJxTTMoPSmNkYGAo5gUSYZmp5S6pyflFiSX5RcFsQBHfxJKizAoAs04KOA==*)(*]GB*) . (*GB[*){{x}(*||*),(*||*){y}(*||*),(*||*){z}(*||*),(*||*){1}}(*||*)(*1:eJxTTMoPSmNkYGAo5gUSYZmp5S6pyflFiSX5RcFsQBHfxJKizAoAs04KOA==*)(*]GB*) // MatrixForm

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
(*GB[*){{tx+x}(*||*),(*||*){ty+y}(*||*),(*||*){tz+z}(*||*),(*||*){1}}(*||*)(*1:eJxTTMoPSmNkYGAo5gUSYZmp5S6pyflFiSX5RcFsQBHfxJKizAoAs04KOA==*)(*]GB*)

