.md
### Try it by yourself!

We can now change the character of the waves without editing GLSL. Here is a gently moving patch on a flat base. `WaterMaterial[0.08, 3.0, 0.6]` stands for amplitude `0.08`, base frequency `3`, and speed `0.6`. We increase `PlotPoints -> 65` so that we have enough vertices to play with

